then, I would usually do the following:

add this to preprocessing (only for the failing scan): --bold_inho_cor method=N4_reg,otsu_thresh=2,multiotsu=false and then try to re-run
if it fails again, add --bold_autobox and try again
if it fails again, add --bold_robust_inho_cor apply=true,masking=true,brain_extraction=true,template_registration=Affine and try again
if it fails again, make a copy of the raw file in the bids folder, 
then use the fslroi function to only keep the brain in the image and discard everything none brain. you can lookup the fslroi help in the terminal.
 if really stuck, i can show you